<title>FRANCE: Reuters eighth ex-Paris air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters eighth ex-Paris air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are current average ex-Paris French franc air cargo rates per kilo for a 100 kg shipment with volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-on.</p>
<p>						 Oct 15	   Sept 11</p>
<p>				  NORTH AMERICA</p>
<p>    PAR-JFK				  5.40	     5.45</p>
<p>    PAR-CHI				  5.85	     5.90</p>
<p>    PAR- LA				  6.65	     6.65</p>
<p>    PAR-YMX (Montreal)		   6.65	     6.70</p>
<p>				  ASIA/PACIFIC</p>
<p>    PAR-SEL				 11.30	    11.40</p>
<p>    PAR-NAR				 14.50	    14.70</p>
<p>    PAR -TPE				 7.60	     7.70</p>
<p>    PAR-HKG				  8.30	     8.40</p>
<p>    PAR-SIN				  8.20	     8.20</p>
<p>    PAR-NOU (New Caledonia)	   39.95	    39.95</p>
<p>    PAR-PPT  (Tahiti)		   33.35	    33.35</p>
<p>				  MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p>    PAR-DXB				  5.35	     5.40</p>
<p>				  INDIAN OCEAN</p>
<p>    PAR-RUN (Reunion)		   21.15	    21.15</p>
<p>				  FRENCH WEST INDIES</p>
<p>    PAR/FDF/PTP			   14.70	    14.70</p>
<p>				  AFRICA</p>
<p>    PAR-JNB				 14.30	    14.60</p>
<p>The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller cargo agents based at the Paris airports.</p>
<p>All prices are quoted in French francs.</p>
<p>The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax+171 542 5017</p>
</text>
